---
exclude_paths:
  - .github/

# The production profile demands things this repo deliberately does not do
# (fully qualified collection names are used, but every task also has to be
# idempotent by ansible-lint's static reading, which it cannot see through a
# shipped script). `safety` is the level whose findings have all been real here.
profile: safety

# Nothing is skipped on purpose. Every command/shell task in these roles sets
# changed_when explicitly — several to `false`, because running a vendor's own
# updater is not a change this playbook converges on — so the rule that would
# otherwise be the first candidate for a skip has nothing to say.
warn_list:
  - experimental
